  descText: {fileID: 2949713768860199114}
  welcomeTxt: Welcome to number merge game.
  tut1: Click and merge cards.
  tut2: Merge cards and make bigger number.
  tut3: Merge five cards at once to make a special card.
  tut4: Special card will give more score.
  tut5: Special card can only merge with special card.
  tut6: Sometime you have to move the card to merge it.
  tut7: Click on move button then click on cards to move.
  tut8: Well done! Let's start the journey now.
